  <section class="np-section" id="movements">
    <div class="np-shell">
      <header class="np-section-head" data-reveal>
        <span class="np-slug">Section A · Method</span>
        <h2 class="np-section-title">Blank page to finished PDF, in three movements</h2>
        <p class="np-standfirst">
          Written for people with a deadline today — freelancers sending an invoice, offices sending a
          letter, anyone who needs the paperwork to look like it was set properly.
        </p>
      </header>
      <ol class="np-movements">
        <li class="np-movement" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 0ms">
          <span class="np-movement-num" aria-hidden="true">I</span>
          <h3>Choose a starting sheet</h3>
          <p>
            Open a blank A4 page, or lift a finished layout straight from the classifieds — invoice,
            letter, CV, proposal, report, menu.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="np-movement" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 90ms">
          <span class="np-movement-num" aria-hidden="true">II</span>
          <h3>Set the page</h3>
          <p>
            Place text, tables, images, shapes and signatures. Guides, layers and page thumbnails keep
            a long document in order while you work.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="np-movement" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 180ms">
          <span class="np-movement-num" aria-hidden="true">III</span>
          <h3>Pull the proof</h3>
          <p>
            Export a real PDF with the fonts embedded and the page size intact. Send it, print it, or
            file it away — the copy is yours.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

